  "description": "The proposal will improve the acoustic performance of the Hong Kong Theatre in Clement House. It is based around three main interventions. A new area of acoustic panels on the wall behind the speaker (1), introduction of acoustic curtains on the lower level windows (2) and the introduction of a system of\nacoustic baffles (3) which would be suspended from the ceiling by fine gauge wires. Existing down lights would be replaced by suspended down lights, which would be coordinated with and hang between some of the baffles.",
